# Frontend (Vite / Vercel)
# StackLens frontend calls `/api/*` same-origin.
# - In dev, Vite proxies /api/* to http://localhost:4000 (see vite.config.ts)
# - In prod, the repo-root vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the api/index.js
#   serverless function (same Vercel project — no separate backend deploy).
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables are exposed to the browser bundle. Never put
# secrets here — anything in this file is public once built.

# Optional: Sentry error tracking for the browser app (public value, a DSN is
# safe to expose). Unset = Sentry code is never even bundled.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://<key>@o<org>.ingest.sentry.io/<project>
